{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2024-05/1065158/block/singleImage/3274944/df/bztqdgxz9cpw.jpg?updatedAt=1795400107\"/><figcaption>港鐵表示，於何文田站附近的事故已妥善處理，觀塘綫列車服務逐步恢復正常。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>港鐵表示，於何文田站附近的事故已妥善處理，觀塘綫列車服務逐步恢復正常。 港鐵早前表示，由於何文田站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛，觀塘綫來往黃埔站及調景嶺站的行車時間預計需要額外10至15分鐘。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:49:26.688311+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T02:15:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T01:48:08.339754+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T03:42:41.161813+00:00","content_hash":"b6ab1ea11c6c0b7763f1f08a564d0b2e9f596c33bed7e1c043b37eb9eee88186","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:49:26.688311+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}